    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/26 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 09 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.09\n\nNo. 2444/26 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 09, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT\n\n(CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMinistry of Lands\u2019 Reference No.: 4-3/7/2020/hw/205.\n\nMy Reference No.: DIVPG/LND/LA AQURE/6/13.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following lands/servitudes which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nThe allotments of land depicted in the Sheet No. 01 of Block No. 01 of Cadastral Map No. 421705 dated 09.06.2025 prepared by the Surveyor General, having the names and the extents as mentioned below, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 881 of Ahugoda West, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Polgahawela, in Kurunegala District, in North Western Province, described as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 - Name of the land: -; Claimant: L. H. M. Chaminda Bandara and others, Udawatta, Ahugoda, Pothuhera; Extent: 0.0228 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 - Name of the land: Udawattehena; Claimant: A. M. Gnanawathi, Ahugoda, Pothuhera; Extent: 0.0073 Hectare. 03. Lot No. 3 - Name of the land: Udawattehena; Claimant: A. M. Thilakarathne Banda, Ahugoda, Pothuhera; Extent: 0.0065 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands / servitudes on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat Polgahawela, 31st day of July 2025 at 10.00 a.m."
