    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/22 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 08 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.08\n\nNo. 2444/22 - TUESDAY, JULY 08, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: WGSWD&EIP/ACQ/KB/24. Ministry of Agriculture, Land, Livestock and Irrigation\n\nRef. No. : 4/3/10/2014/LRB/52.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act that the Government has acquired the allotments of the paddy lands located between Neelammahara road at Boralesgamuwa and Pasal Mawatha at Bokundara Piliyandala are required for canal development, construction of a water tank, water reserve, townscape development and resettlement of displaced persons under Weras Ganga Storm Water Drainage and Environment Improvement Project.:-\n\nDescription of the land acquired : The allotments of lands, depicted as Lot Nos. 02, 03, 04, 05, 06, 07, 09, 10, 12, 15, 16, 19 and 20 in Sheet No. 07, Block No. 02 of the Cadastral Map No. 521239 dated 03.06.2025 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Katuwawala (Ward No. 5 within the Urban Council Limit of Kesbewa) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District of the Western Province and bounded as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Pinwagure Kumbura alias Pinwagure Owita; Description : Owita; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mr. D. Jayawickrama, No. 210/68/D, Isuru Uyana Neelammahara Road, Boralesgamuwa; Extent: 0.0223 Hectare.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - PG 7194 - 15 (07/2025)\n\n02. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: Kosinna Kumbura; Description : Owita; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mr. D. Jayawickrama, No. 210/68/D, Isuru Uyana, Neelammahara Road, Boralesgamuwa; Extent: 0.0059 Hectare."
