    "chunk_text": "3AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.08PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.07.2025\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\n\u201cWhether the non-payment of the 04 salary increments due from 01.04.2005 and the arrears in respect of the same and the promotions to the posts of Senior Supplies Of\ufb01cer and Supplies Manager not been given to Mr. A. D. Jayasinghe who worked as a Supplies Of\ufb01cer of the Ceylon Fishery Harbours Corporation are just and if not so, to what relief he is entitled. H. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Of\ufb01ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo,on this 18th day of June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0084/2\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2024/133.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter speci\ufb01ed in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour which accompanies this order exists between,\n\nFlight Attendants Union, No. 01, Jayakontha Lane, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Airline Centre, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayake.\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes-Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. Obadage Leelarathne, Attorney-at-Law, No. 242, Sri Sobhitha Mawatha, Nagoda, Kalutara to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,03rd July, 2025.\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.08"
