    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.04PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.07.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/19 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 08 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.08No. 2444/19 \u2013 TUESDAY, JULY 08, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe boundary for following allotment of land of name and extent depicted in the Advance Tracing No. MR/WLG/2023/396 dated 07.12.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Mirissa South 1 in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 406 of Mirissa South 1 in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Weligama in Matara District in the Southern Province:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Dombagahawatta and Dombagaha-koratuwa alias Dodamgahawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.1963 Hectare North: Thewarahennadigewatta claimed by Punam Kristhombuge Shirani, Pokunewatta claimed by Saundra\n\nHennadige Hemawathi and Pokunewatta claimed by Galappaththige Prasanna and Kottagahawatta claimant not be found; East: Nadoge Ammagewatta alias Paranagedarawatta claimant not be found and Road; South: Road; West: Thumbodhigewatta alias Thewarahennadigewatta claimed by Chaminda Punchihewa, Thumbodhigewatta alias Thewarahennadigewatta claimant not be found, Harbour Road, Dombagahakoratuwa alias Dodamgahawatta claimed by H. H. Pethum Sanjeewa and Thewarahennadigewatta claimed by Punam Kristhombuge Shirani.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation."
