    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/13 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 08 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.08 No. 2444/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, JULY 08, 2025 - 08.07.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A : G 044767 \u2013 44 (07/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 Reference No. : 03/J/83/1R/85. My No. : DDIVKT/LND/LAQIG/04/1-111. I hereby inform that the Government is intended to acquire ownership of following lands for public purpose under Sub Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964.\n\nDescription of the Lands intended to acquire :\n\nLot No. 228 to 391 Depicted in the Additional 1 in Sheet No. 1 in the Final Village Plan No. 3485 at No. 229, 230 Palugolla Village in Magul Medagandahe East Korale, Kotawehera Divisional Secretary's Division, Kurunegala District, North Western Province:\n\n01. Lot No. 228 Name of Land: Galmaduwala Yaya; Owner: Government; Extent: 0.5236. Hec Boundaries: North by : Lot No. 230; East by : Lot No. 230; South by : Lot No. 230; West by : Lot No. 203. 02. Lot No.229 Name of Land:Tharana Wewa Yaya; Galmaduwala Yaya; Owner: Government: Estent; 0.6762 Hec Boundaries: North by: Lot No. 230; East by: Lot Nos. 230 and 18; South by: Lot Nos. 243 and 242;West by: Lot No.231; 03.Lot No. 231 Name of Land: Tharana Wewa Yayaa (Entrance Way); Owner: Government; Extent: 0 3265 Hec Boundaries: -\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0