    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2444/08 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 07 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.07\n\nNo. 2444/08 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 07, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref No.: Thiprale/1/8/3/99 ath. Ministry of Land Reference No.: 4-3/7/2021/HW/28.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub - Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act. No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land / servitude which is required for the public purpose:\n\nDetails of the Expansion and Acquisitioned Land. Land Acquisition for the Railway Track Construction of the segment from Kollupitiya to Galle Face under the Marine Drive Extent Project (1 + 200 km - 2 + 500 km) Lot Nos. 01 - 06, Allotments of Land in total extent 0.6533 Hectare only. Prepared by Licensed Surveyor General Tracing No : 520425 dated 26.12.2024, situated at Kollupitiya Village, Galle Face, Grama Niladhari Division. (Division No. 37 within the limits of Colombo Municipal Council Area) in Colombo Divisional Secretariat, Colombo District, Western Province. The details of the following land:\n\n01. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Indian Ocean; Present usage of the Land: Sea, a portion of abandoned bridge; Name and\n\naddress of the claiments: Government; Extents: 0.5978 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02 Name of the land: Not Known. Assmt. No - 02, No. 23rd Lane; Present usage of the Land: Gardens; Name and address of the claimants: Army Camp Sri Lanka; Extents: 0.0002 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 03 Name of the land: Not Known. Assmt. No - 06, No. 23rd Lane; Present usage of the Land: Gardens; Name and address of the claimants: S. P. Fonseka and A. A. S. J. Fonseka, No. 578, Galle Road, Colombo 03; Extents: 0.0013 Hectare."
