    "chunk_text": "Sugath sisira kumara, Divisional Secretary, Thimbirigasyaya. Divisional Secretariat, Thimbirigasyaya, 04th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0067\n\nAmendment\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No. of Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock,\n\nLand and Irrigation.: 4-3/10/2019/MV/183.\n\n06.08.2025 and those who claim in respect of the aforesaid allotments of land should submit relevant supporting documents on or before 31.07.2025. S. wijayakumar, Divisional Secretary, Naula. At the Divisional Secretariat, Naula, 02nd July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0068\n\nAmendment\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No. of Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock,\n\nLand and Irrigation.: 4-3/10/2020/MV/109.\n\nMy Reference No. : 6/3/7/15/5/7/8. IT is hereby informed that the Notice issued under Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act for date of inquiry for claims in respect of allotments of land in Lot Nos. 01 in sheet No. 01 in Block No. 03 in Cadastral Map No. 310208 of Surveyor General and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2435/11 and dated 08.05.2025 is hereby amended therein as 06.08.2025 and those who claim in respect of the aforesaid allotments of land should submit relevant supporting documents on or before 31.07.2025. S. wijayakumar, Divisional Secretary, Naula. At the Divisional Secretariat, Naula, 02nd July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0069\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
