    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.07.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/73 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0288\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.05No. 2443/73 \u2013 SATURDAY, JULY 05, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nMy No.: N/DS/L/ACQ/PTK/05(iii).\n\nI, Aliyar Maraikar Abdul Latheef, Divisional Secretary of the Division of Nintavur in Ampara District in terms of Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) hereby give notice that a sum of Rs. Three Hundred and Seventy one Thousand (Rs. 371,000/-) being compensation for the acquisition of the land described in the Schedule below has been deposited under Case No. SPL/1459/2025 of the District Court of Kalmunai to be drawn by the person entitled thereto.\n\nA. M. Abdul Latheef, Divisional Secretary, Ninthavur.\n\n30th June, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nName of the land : Pottakkulam - Nintavur - 24Plan No. : PP/AM/3943Lot No. : 01Extent : 0.1251 HectareSituation : Situated in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 24 of Nintavur in the Minor Division of Nintavur Pattu in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nintavur in Ampara District.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0060\n\n1A \u2013 G 044755 \u2013 24 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
