    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/71 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc1\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.05\n\nNo. 2443/71 - SATURDAY, JULY 05, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry\u2019s Ref. No. : 4-3/18/2021/WS/04.\n\nMy No. : RUW/LAN/ACQTN/A2/226. I hereby notify that under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, as amended by Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose. Public Purpose : Acquisition of Lands for Construction of inlet and Pump House of Water Scheme, Ruwanwella.\n\nDescription of the land proposed to be obtained : Allotment called No. 02 in extent of 0.0776 Hectare described below of Cadastral Map No. 610446 Zone 02 Sheet No. 02 dated 04.04.2025 prepared by Superintendent of Surveys, situated in the Village of Moraliya in Grama Niladhari Division of No. 103A Moraliya in Dehigampal Korale in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ruwanwella in Kegalle District in Sabaragamuwa Province:\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 044753 - 29 (07/2025)\n\n01. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Ruwanwella Estate; Original Claimant : Malwatta Valley Plantations PLC; Extent: 0.0776 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Ruwanwella on 15th day of October, 2025 at 09.00 a.m."
  },
