    "chunk_text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat, Ruwanwella on 15th day of October, 2025 at 09.00 a.m.\n\nH. D. S. N. Hettige, Divisional Secretary, Ruwanwella. At Divisional Secretariat, Ruwanwella, 30th June, 2025. EOG 07 - 0056\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.07.05 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.07.2025\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No. : NPC/LND/ACQSN/18/1/2. Ref. No. of the Ministry of Lands: 4-3/9/2017/IR/448-A.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired: Public purpose means to acquire lands for the construction of the Lower Malwathu Oya Reservoir.\n\nThe 43 plots of land described below in Total Extent of about 16.0168 Hectares, as depicted in Cadastral Map No. 110236, Block No. 02 and Sheet No. 1 dated 29.12.2023 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Asirikgama (Moragahawala, Moragahawewa) in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 308, Asirikgama in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nuwaragam Palatha Central in Anuradhapura District, North Central Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 2 Name of Land: Puranawela, Moragahawewayaya; Land Use: Paddy field; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Pichche Thambi Adambawa; Extent: 1.1546 Hectares.\n\nBoundaries: North by: Lot No. 1, Lot No. 1029 in F.T.P. 8 and Lot No. 3 of this plan; East by: Lot Nos. 3, 8, 4, 8, 5, 8 and 7; South by: Lot Nos. 7, 6 and 1; West by: Lot No. 1."
