    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.04PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.07.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/70 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.04No. 2443/70 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 04, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAll that allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Maha/PSK/2023/129 dated 31.05.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Dekinda in the Grama Niladhari Division of Mapakanda (Division No. 1101) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pasbage Korale in the District of Kandy, Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Panwile Mookalana, Panwilepathana \u2013 Extent: About 0.0278 Hectare North and East: P.P.A. 1120 Lot No. 82; South: P.P.A. 1120 Lot No. 82 and Lot B; West: Lot B and P.P.A. 1120 Lot No. 82.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/18/2022/WS/41.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.20th May, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0048\n\n1A \u2013 G 044747 \u2013 24 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
