    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1 : 32 of Block 6, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 620293, situated in the Village of Batugedara, Pelwadiya within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 181B - Thiriwanaketiya in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Ratnapura, in the District of Ratnapura, in the Province of Sabaragamuwa, referred to in Notice No. 62/0373 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1909/23 of 08th April, 2015 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 14th May, 2025.\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/63 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.04\n\nNo. 2443/63 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 04, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044740 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u