    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1 : 72, 1 : 118 and 3 : 212 of Block 2, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 410011, situated in the Village of Wennappuwa within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 491B - Meda Wennappuwa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Wennappuwa, in the District of Puttalam, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 41/0036 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1864/36 of 28th May, 2014 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 09th April, 2025.\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/45 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 02 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.02\n\nNo. 2443/45 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 02, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044729 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca