    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration AMENDMENT REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, NO. 21 OF 1998 (Section 14) IN regard to the title to parcel of land No. 20 and 26 Sheet No 01 of Block 02 contained in the Cadastral Map No. 420360 situated in the village of Porapola within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 768 - Pubbowa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kurunegala in the District of Kurunegala in the Province of North West published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2405/24 of 09th October , 2024. \u201cRight to access with servitude of parcel No 89\u201d mentioned in the column \u201cParticulars regarding Mortgages Encumbrances pending Adjudication and injunction\u201d is removed. P. C. D.S\u0d82\u0d80\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 09th June, 2025 EOG 07-0025/1\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044726 - 04 (07/2025)\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2443/42 - 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 02 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.07.02\n\nNo. 2443/42 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 02, 2025\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2025.07.02 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u201